§§ `Fixtures: section 2 cases`

`a threat to damage another's property` MEANS `Section 2 facts` WITH
    `a threat made to another` IS TRUE
    `intending that that other would fear it would be carried out` IS TRUE
    `the property threatened` IS `property that another has custody of`
    `the threatened damage` IS `ordinary destruction or damage`
    `knowing it likely that the threatened destruction or damage would endanger the life of that other or a third person` IS FALSE
    `lawful excuse` IS `no lawful excuse`

`no threat is made` MEANS `Section 2 facts` WITH
    `a threat made to another` IS FALSE
    `intending that that other would fear it would be carried out` IS TRUE
    `the property threatened` IS `property that another has custody of`
    `the threatened damage` IS `ordinary destruction or damage`
    `knowing it likely that the threatened destruction or damage would endanger the life of that other or a third person` IS FALSE
    `lawful excuse` IS `no lawful excuse`

`a threat not intended to be feared` MEANS `Section 2 facts` WITH
    `a threat made to another` IS TRUE
    `intending that that other would fear it would be carried out` IS FALSE
    `the property threatened` IS `property that another has custody of`
    `the threatened damage` IS `ordinary destruction or damage`
    `knowing it likely that the threatened destruction or damage would endanger the life of that other or a third person` IS FALSE
    `lawful excuse` IS `no lawful excuse`

`a threat to do no destruction or damage` MEANS `Section 2 facts` WITH
    `a threat made to another` IS TRUE
