    `the property threatened` IS `property that another has custody of`
    `the threatened damage` IS `no destruction or damage`
    `knowing it likely that the threatened destruction or damage would endanger the life of that other or a third person` IS FALSE
    `lawful excuse` IS `no lawful excuse`

