-- damaging another's property, recklessly endangering life. Expected: an offence under s 1(1) is committed -- both s 1(1) and s 1(2): s 1(2)(b) is satisfied by recklessness as to life.
#ASSERT `a person commits an offence under section 1(1)` `damaging another's property, recklessly endangering life`

-- damaging another's property, recklessly endangering life. Expected: an offence under s 1(2) is committed -- both s 1(1) and s 1(2): s 1(2)(b) is satisfied by recklessness as to life.
#ASSERT `a person commits an offence under section 1(2)` `damaging another's property, recklessly endangering life`

