§§ `Section 1(3): arson`

-- damaging another's property intentionally. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: True).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging another's property intentionally`)

-- recklessly damaging another's property. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: True).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `recklessly damaging another's property`)

-- damaging another's property with no intent and no recklessness. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: False).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging another's property with no intent and no recklessness`)

-- intending to damage property in general but not the property damaged. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: False).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `intending to damage property in general but not the property damaged`)

-- endangering life with no destruction or damage. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: False).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `endangering life with no destruction or damage`)

-- damaging only one's own property, intentionally. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: False).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging only one's own property, intentionally`)

-- damaging only one's own property, intending to endanger life. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: True).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging only one's own property, intending to endanger life`)

-- damaging another's property, recklessly endangering life. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: True).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging another's property, recklessly endangering life`)

-- damaging property shared with another. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: True).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging property shared with another`)

-- damaging property that nobody has any connection with, intending to endanger life. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: True).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging property that nobody has any connection with, intending to endanger life`)

-- damaging a wild mushroom, intending to endanger life. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: False).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging a wild mushroom, intending to endanger life`)

-- altering the contents of a computer only. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: False).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `altering the contents of a computer only`)

-- altering the contents of a computer and impairing it physically. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: True).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `altering the contents of a computer and impairing it physically`)

-- damaging another's property, honestly believing the owner consented, endangering life. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: True).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging another's property, honestly believing the owner consented, endangering life`)

-- damaging another's property, with a belief in consent that was not honestly held. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: True).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging another's property, with a belief in consent that was not honestly held`)

-- damaging another's property with another lawful excuse, endangering life. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: False).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging another's property with another lawful excuse, endangering life`)

-- damaging another's property to protect property, endangering life. Expected: need NOT be charged as arson (fire: False; offence: True).
#ASSERT NOT (`an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging another's property to protect property, endangering life`)

-- damaging another's property by fire. Expected: must be charged as arson (fire: True; offence: True).
#ASSERT `an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging another's property by fire`

-- damaging one's own property by fire, intending to endanger life. Expected: must be charged as arson (fire: True; offence: True).
#ASSERT `an offence under section 1 must be charged as arson` `damaging one's own property by fire, intending to endanger life`

