-- damaging another's property intentionally. Expected: the offences committed under section 1 are exactly: an offence under section 1(1), not by fire.
#ASSERT `the offences committed under section 1` `damaging another's property intentionally` EQUALS LIST `an offence under section 1(1), not by fire`

