#ASSERT `the offences committed under section 1` `damaging property that nobody has any connection with, intending to endanger life` EQUALS LIST `an offence under section 1(2), not by fire`

-- damaging a wild mushroom, intending to endanger life. Expected: the offences committed under section 1 are exactly: none.
#ASSERT `the offences committed under section 1` `damaging a wild mushroom, intending to endanger life` EQUALS EMPTY

-- altering the contents of a computer only. Expected: the offences committed under section 1 are exactly: none.
#ASSERT `the offences committed under section 1` `altering the contents of a computer only` EQUALS EMPTY

